[RUNNING]● Message: Implemented a server-rendered catalog experience and theme tooling so storefront pages can honor tenant palettes while exposing localized filters.

- `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/rest/StorefrontResource.java:166` now reads generated theme tokens and utilities to build category/filter metadata, while `modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/templates/base.html:25` + `modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/templates/storefront/_theme.css:1` centralize how CSS vars reach Qute layouts.
